WEBVTT

00:00.450 --> 00:04.850
Every codebase has a shape. Most of us never get to see it.

00:04.850 --> 00:10.735
Type /draw-c4. It reads the source: routes, configs, queues.

00:12.350 --> 00:17.250
Then it writes one HTML file. Your system, as a map.

00:17.250 --> 00:20.831
Double-click a box to open what’s inside.

00:22.450 --> 00:28.305
Press play, and follow one request, hop by hop, through the code that handles it.

00:31.550 --> 00:35.520
Each step carries the real details from the code.

00:36.850 --> 00:40.928
Dark or light. One file. Open it anywhere.

00:41.550 --> 00:46.706
draw-c4. A Claude Code skill. Install it, and see your code.
